# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# As rc.jobs.widgetsopen, the first opening 100 s after the job starts instead of 38 (11-11: is a fresh boot's stall
# the boot's own work still going on?). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.widgetslate.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 100
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 4 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 4 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
